  "name": "CounterStrike_Deathmatch",
  "description": "This dataset contains video, action labels, and metadata from the popular video game CS:GO.Past usecases include imitation learning, behavioral cloning, world modeling, video generation. \nThe paper presenting the dataset:Counter-Strike Deathmatch with Large-Scale Behavioural CloningTim Pearce, Jun ZhuIEEE Conference on Games (CoG) 2022 [\u2b50\ufe0f Best Paper Award!]ArXiv paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.04258 (Contains some extra experiments not in CoG version)CoG paper:\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/TeaPearce/CounterStrike_Deathmatch.",
